Fana Hues // Photo: Press)", "duration": 9117, "lastUpdated": "2026-08-07T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2018-01-23T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/1d6cf7e5-8015-48ec-adfd-8dd65ea2d9cf", "image": "2f4def8e-0c48-4bf7-bfdf-f7c5ecebad1a", "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "d6a465aa-3772-4959-888d-77ce86b968ea", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "02afd153-63ca-448f-ba61-baddbfdc3dca", "title": "R&B: Artists to Watch 2025", "numberOfTracks": 25, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {}, "description": "The next generation of R&B artists that will break through are here. Watch for these artists to make an impact in 2025. (Cover: Jaz Karis // Photo: Press)", "duration": 4415, "lastUpdated": "2025-01-09T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2024-09-10T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/02afd153-63ca-448f-ba61-baddbfdc3dca", "image": "8cdea01a-1efb-4a08-b3a1-faf91ee79623", "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "e3f3ecbd-670e-44fc-909b-8926985063da", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "3253116d-10fd-4edd-9039-38fa6f48ee1b", "title": "R&B Collabs", "numberOfTracks": 20, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {}, "description": "When two R&B artists get together, expect nothing less than a masterpiece to be delivered. Vibe out to a collection of some of today's R&B hit makers connecting, in this playlist. (Photo: Unsplash)", "duration": 3730, "lastUpdated": "2024-08-14T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2023-08-28T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/3253116d-10fd-4edd-9039-38fa6f48ee1b", "image": "b9f55f13-d8f4-4757-bc62-b65f4065562a", "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "0166134c-fb08-4350-8d1a-257d8bf62e4f", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "221934ea-dd16-41d3-bea0-7a703c28f08a", "title": "Afromapiano", "numberOfTracks": 49, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {}, "description": "Amapiano has been sweeping the African continent in recent years, driven by South African producers and DJs including DJ Maphorisa, MFR Souls and Kabza De Small. This mellow house-influenced dance music has inspired artists from Nigeria, Tanzania and beyond to create their own Afromapiano blends. This playlist brings together some of the best Amapiano-influenced pop music being made outside of Mzansi. ", "duration": 9804, "lastUpdated": "2023-09-29T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2021-09-15T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/221934ea-dd16-41d3-bea0-7a703c28f08a", "image": null, "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "433a5697-316e-4053-83fa-14921f86e2f5", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "c805f853-7e62-4ce1-9504-6429a29bd669", "title": "Alternative Christmas in Switzerland", "numberOfTracks": 125, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {}, "description": "These non-traditonal Christmas hits celebrate the holiday in space, prison and other places. Dive into all feelings the season has to offer. ", "duration": 25660, "lastUpdated": "2021-11-29T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2018-11-23T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/c805f853-7e62-4ce1-9504-6429a29bd669", "image": "14b24c67-0815-4d92-9d08-da3d17aff35c", "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "d48e3235-c8cc-4ee2-a3c4-e54f215419e5", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "3966e1a6-97d5-4347-85fa-ef7be809a97f", "title": "Sauti Sol Essentials", "numberOfTracks": 25, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {}, "description": "Kenya afro-pop superstars Sauti Sol formed in Nairobi in 2006, and have become one of the most critically acclaimed and popular bands coming out of the vibrant Kenyan music scene in the 21st century. Sauti Sol have collaborated with Spoek Mathambo, Burna Boy, Tiwa Savage and numerous others, and received national and international accolades.   ", "duration": 6101, "lastUpdated": "2023-09-13T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2018-10-04T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/3966e1a6-97d5-4347-85fa-ef7be809a97f", "image": "5c0eca9f-2743-433f-8951-662dadc5a16d", "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "cb862ce0-8025-499c-ad9f-72589b36b8e2", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "b70ca5ef-d3b9-4c1f-8bf6-01de056d8d47", "title": "Funaná Fire", "numberOfTracks": 30, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {}, "description": "Fast-paced dance music from the mountains of Santiago, Cape Verde, funaná is fiercely proud, Black resistance music. Forbidden by Portuguese colonists, there are few early recorded examples of funaná. In the '80s, the group Bulimundo recorded arrangements of funaná translated to synths, guitars and drums, but traditional funana lived underground until the '90s, when Ferro Gaito, Bitori and Chando began to record the genre the way it was actually played in the mountains: with ferro (iron scraper) and gaita (accordion) and added percussion, bass and drums. In recent years, DJs added hard house elements to create fuananá cotxi po. Today, funaná is one of the common genres of popular music in Cape Verde and the diaspora. ", "duration": 8832, "lastUpdated": "2023-10-04T00:00:00.000+0000", "created": "2021-09-15T00:00:00.000+0000", "type": "EDITORIAL", "publicPlaylist": true, "url": "http://www.tidal.com/playlist/b70ca5ef-d3b9-4c1f-8bf6-01de056d8d47", "image": null, "popularity": 0, "squareImage": "c210c795-1f53-43e4-8ae6-d94cdf857f4c", "customImageUrl": null, "promotedArtists": [], "lastItemAddedAt": null}, {"uuid": "521b3fd1-2ac5-4bcc-aad4-f3197d876e78", "title": "Oliver 'Tuku' Mtukudzi Essentials", "numberOfTracks": 25, "numberOfVideos": 0, "creator": {